    "detailed_description": "Collect nectar as a tiny honey bee while flying through various gorgeous environments and avoiding dangers ranging from other insects to harmful plants and even other small animals. Nectarmare is a single-player game and includes the following features.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Gorgeous professional art<br />\r\n-Challenging arcade-feeling gameplay<br />\r\n- Over 50 levels to collect nectar in.<br />\r\n-Challenge yourself to see how much nectar you can collect in our challenge mode.<br />\r\n-Atmospheric music<br />\r\n-Steam achievements.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game was developed by<br />\r\nStanislav Hallberg, Ingeborg Asplund and Natali Hallberg.<br />\r\nThe game's music and audio was made by Mary-Ann Sensoy",
    "about_the_game": "Collect nectar as a tiny honey bee while flying through various gorgeous environments and avoiding dangers ranging from other insects to harmful plants and even other small animals. Nectarmare is a single-player game and includes the following features.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Gorgeous professional art<br />\r\n-Challenging arcade-feeling gameplay<br />\r\n- Over 50 levels to collect nectar in.<br />\r\n-Challenge yourself to see how much nectar you can collect in our challenge mode.<br />\r\n-Atmospheric music<br />\r\n-Steam achievements.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game was developed by<br />\r\nStanislav Hallberg, Ingeborg Asplund and Natali Hallberg.<br />\r\nThe game's music and audio was made by Mary-Ann Sensoy",
    "short_description": "Nectarmare is a single player game where you control a bee collecting nectar for the winter. But watch out there are many things that will hurt or even eat a small bee out in the wild. The environment is full of dangers so take care while chasing for nectar.",
